    "sections": {
        "description": "Shop Startup is a modern, responsive WooCommerce WordPress theme designed to create professional online shops and storefronts. Perfect for fashion boutiques, lifestyle brands, homeware sellers, and marketplaces, it combines sleek design with powerful WooCommerce features like product wishlists, comparison tools, and variation swatches. Fully compatible with Elementor, Divi, Visual Composer, and Gutenberg, it offers effortless customization, while its SEO-friendly, mobile-responsive, and fast-loading structure ensures a smooth shopping experience across all devices. With RTL support, flexible layouts, and conversion-focused styling, Shop Startup is the ideal shop theme for building a standout WooCommerce storefront."
    },
